= Clara Zetkin

Clara Zetkin our one of our oldest members and our most senior female leader. She has been a pioneer in Marxist-feminism, having worked with the late Rosa Luxemburg, and chairwomen of Rote Hilfe. Though situated on our party's right wing and often comes into conflict with the Marxist Leninists, she has remained in the party as a highly valued member.

